{"title": "[花邊] 老河：字母打法太單一，每次都只想硬打", "author": "Wojnarowski (@wojespn)", "board": "", "date": "Fri Nov  6 13:46:33 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1793943996.A.3F7.html", "body": "Doc Rivers tells Bill Simmons it was so hard for him to coach Giannis Antetoko\nunmpo during his tenure with the Milwaukee Bucks:\n\n“He’s not easy. He plays at this crazy downhill pace. He’s really a difficu\nlt guy. He has this great passing ability, but he doesn’t have a super-high I\nQ at the same time. He really has only one way of playing. Every play, he want\ns to force it. I wish he’d learned how to execute better.\n\n“The thing he still needs to learn is the value of execution how important it\n is, when you’re in practice and at shoot around, to lock in on execution. No\nw he has a coach who’s as good as there is at execution.” x.com/thepercsgotm\ne/…\n\nhttps://x.com/big_business_/status/2118567824209670554\n\nDoc Rivers在接受Bill Simmons訪問時，談到自己執教公鹿期間，表示要執教Giannis An\ntetokounmpo是一件非常困難的事：\n\n他並不是一個容易執教的球員。他打球的節奏非常瘋狂，總是一路往籃框衝。他真的是個\n很難帶的球員。\n\n他的傳球能力非常出色，但同時，他的籃球智商又沒有高到那種程度。他的打法基本上只\n有一種。每一次進攻，他都想強行突破、硬打。我真希望他能學會如何更好地執行戰術。\n\n他現在仍然需要學習的一件事，就是理解戰術執行的重要性。無論是在訓練或投籃練習時\n，都必須專注於戰術執行。而現在，他有了一位在戰術執行方面堪稱頂尖的教練。\n\n短評或心得：\n\n老河又..", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "vgil", "content": "你總教練不會教？", "time": "11/06 13:47"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "pneumo", "content": "早說 怎麼不早說", "time": "11/06 13:47"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ooxxman", "content": "老河甩鍋", "time": "11/06 13:47"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "drcula", "content": "現在是分手後什麼都敢說了是吧", "time": "11/06 13:47"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "hasroten", "content": "說點大家不知道的", "time": "11/06 13:47"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "richard1003", "content": "這好像無法反駁耶", "time": "11/06 13:47"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "www90173", "content": "真心話？", "time": "11/06 13:47"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "BeggarHarden", "content": "還會墊腳啊", "time": "11/06 13:47"}, {"tag": "噓", "user": "cor1os", "content": "同隊時怎麼不敢說", "time": "11/06 13:47"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "nsbgm", "conte